Add_Dynamic_Module Physics Appeal_Box2D_Physics
Add_Dynamic_Module Mechanics Appeal_Default_2D_Side_Scrolling_Mechanics
Add_Dynamic_Module World Appeal_Standard_World
Run Examples/World/Setup_Sprite_Garden
Run Examples/Graphics/Setup_Character_Mechanics
Run Examples/World/Sprite_Garden_Physics
Set_Var Adam_Axis 100
Set_Var Eve_Axis 0
Set_Var Frames 0
Loop While Var Frames < 120
{
 Call Scene_Physics_Update
 Set_Var Frames (Add Var Frames 1)
}
Print (Physics Get Adam Position_X)
Print (Physics Get Adam Grounded)
Print (Mechanics Get Adam Position_Y)
Call Scene_Physics_Close
Done
